    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25849" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διασκην-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>separate and retire each to his billet</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκηναί</span>), <i>take up one's quarters,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διασκηνῆσαι κατὰ τὰς κώμας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					4.4.8
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>go into billets,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				4.5.29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lac.</u>
				5.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>leave</i> another's <i>tent,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διασκηνούντων μετὰ δεῖπνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					3.1.38
				</span></i>
			, dub. in <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HG</u>
				4.8.18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>shade,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lyd.
				<u>Mag.</u>
				3.70
			</span></i>.</div>
